              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 8:11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho mundarira na kusaga meno mana mundaona akare ehu Burahimu, Isaka na Jakobo na manabii osi a kahi za nyo ufalume wa Mlungu, ela mwi enye mukatsuphiwa kondze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu kula mlairo wa dzuwa, na mtswerero wa dzuwa, kula vurini na kula mwakani, andakpwedza karamuni kpwenye ufalume wa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
