            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee, mwi atu a Jerusalemu! Mkuolaga manabii na kuapiga mawe ariohumwa kpwenu. Mara ngaphi náaza kukuikani phamwenga dza kolo ra kuku rifwinikavyo anae mwakpwe maphani, ela mwi mwakahala! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 118:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya phundzani, mkarichirwa mudzi wenu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:35",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mana yanjina ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "nyumba yenu ya kuvoya Mlungu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "au",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "tsi yenu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "(soma chitabu cha",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 118:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ").",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " enye, Mlungu kandakurindani tsona. Nami nakuhakikishirani, tamundaniona tsona hadi wakati ndiphokpwedzaamba, ‘Wajaliwa iye edzaye kpwa dzina ra Mwenyezi Mlungu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.35"
            ]
          }
        }
